{"questions":[{"stem":"Let \\(g(x)=x^6+ax^5+b\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are constants. When \\(g(x)\\) is divided by \\(x-1\\), the remainder is \\(2\\). Find the remainder when \\(g(x)\\) is divided by \\(x+1\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(g(x)=x^6+ax^5+b\\)，其中 \\(a,b\\) 為常數。當 \\(g(x)\\) 被 \\(x-1\\) 除時，餘式為 \\(2\\)。求 \\(g(x)\\) 被 \\(x+1\\) 除的餘式。","hint":"\\(g(1)=2\\Rightarrow1+a+b=2\\), so \\(b=1-a\\).","hintZh":"\\(g(1)=2\\Rightarrow1+a+b=2\\)，所以 \\(b=1-a\\)","solution":"\\(g(1)=2\\Rightarrow1+a+b=2\\), so \\(b=1-a\\). Hence \\(g(-1)=1-a+b=2-2a\\).","solutionZh":"\\(g(1)=2\\Rightarrow1+a+b=2\\)，所以 \\(b=1-a\\)。\\(g(-1)=1-a+b=2-2a\\)。。","id":"import-polynomial-p033","subcategory":"theorems","skill":"poly-direct-remainder","classification":{"version":"2026-10-21.1","basis":"evaluate polynomial at a divisor root","status":"rule-classified","originalTopic":"","sourceLevel":null},"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"formBasis":"Editorial prerequisite recommendation, not a source grade or syllabus certification.","source":"Imported collection; attribution not supplied","sourceZh":"匯入題集；原檔未提供出處","provenance":{"collection":"1013-webpage","sha256":"af56d2daa36f8615eb1f27152fec0951c1a10910ed81dc30f4d3366a6eaebcfd","topic":"polynomial","kind":"mc","sourceId":"P033","row":33,"set":"q-Q09","number":"Q1.","attribution":"not-supplied"},"answer":"C","options":{"A":"\\(2\\)","B":"\\(2a\\)","C":"\\(2-2a\\)","D":"\\(2+2a\\)"},"optionsZh":{"A":"\\(2\\)","B":"\\(2a\\)","C":"\\(2-2a\\)","D":"\\(2+2a\\)"},"course":"core","topicId":"polynomial","category":"mc"},{"stem":"Let \\(g(x)=x^8+ax^7+b\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are constants. If \\(g(x)\\) is divisible by \\(x-1\\), find the remainder when \\(g(x)\\) is divided by \\(x+1\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(g(x)=x^8+ax^7+b\\)，其中 \\(a,b\\) 為常數。若 \\(g(x)\\) 可被 \\(x-1\\) 整除，求 \\(g(x)\\) 被 \\(x+1\\) 除的餘式。","hint":"Since \\(x-1\\) is a factor, \\(g(1)=0\\): \\(1+a+b=0\\), so \\(b=-1-a\\).","hintZh":"\\(x-1\\) 是因式，所以 \\(g(1)=0\\)：\\(1+a+b=0\\)，即 \\(b=-1-a\\)","solution":"Since \\(x-1\\) is a factor, \\(g(1)=0\\): \\(1+a+b=0\\), so \\(b=-1-a\\). Hence \\(g(-1)=1-a+b=-2a\\). One condition does not determine \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) separately, and it does not need to.","solutionZh":"\\(x-1\\) 是因式，所以 \\(g(1)=0\\)：\\(1+a+b=0\\)，即 \\(b=-1-a\\)。因此 \\(g(-1)=1-a+b=-2a\\)。無須、亦無法由一條條件分別求出 \\(a,b\\)。。","id":"import-polynomial-p034","subcategory":"theorems","skill":"poly-multiple-conditions","classification":{"version":"2026-10-21.1","basis":"combine zero remainder and specified remainder","status":"rule-classified","originalTopic":"","sourceLevel":null},"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"formBasis":"Editorial prerequisite recommendation, not a source grade or syllabus certification.","source":"Imported collection; attribution not supplied","sourceZh":"匯入題集；原檔未提供出處","provenance":{"collection":"1013-webpage","sha256":"af56d2daa36f8615eb1f27152fec0951c1a10910ed81dc30f4d3366a6eaebcfd","topic":"polynomial","kind":"mc","sourceId":"P034","row":34,"set":"q-Q09","number":"Q2.","attribution":"not-supplied"},"answer":"C","options":{"A":"\\(0\\)","B":"\\(2a\\)","C":"\\(-2a\\)","D":"\\(-2a+2\\)"},"optionsZh":{"A":"\\(0\\)","B":"\\(2a\\)","C":"\\(-2a\\)","D":"\\(-2a+2\\)"},"course":"core","topicId":"polynomial","category":"mc"},{"stem":"Let \\(g(x)=x^2+ax+b\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are constants. If \\(g(x)\\) is divisible by \\(x+2a\\), find the remainder when \\(g(x)\\) is divided by \\(x-2a\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(g(x)=x^2+ax+b\\)，其中 \\(a,b\\) 為常數。若 \\(g(x)\\) 可被 \\(x+2a\\) 整除，求 \\(g(x)\\) 被 \\(x-2a\\) 除的餘式。","hint":"\\(g(-2a)=0\\Rightarrow2a^2+b=0\\).","hintZh":"\\(g(-2a)=0\\Rightarrow2a^2+b=0\\)","solution":"\\(g(-2a)=0\\Rightarrow2a^2+b=0\\). Thus \\(g(2a)=4a^2+2a^2-2a^2=4a^2\\).","solutionZh":"\\(g(-2a)=0\\Rightarrow2a^2+b=0\\)。所以 \\(g(2a)=4a^2+2a^2-2a^2=4a^2\\)。。","id":"import-polynomial-p035","subcategory":"theorems","skill":"poly-multiple-conditions","classification":{"version":"2026-10-21.1","basi